1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,450
After the tribulation,

25
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,450
the fog in the Sea of Devils dissipated

26
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:01,890
and a strange black rain began falling.

27
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:07,050
Many sects were infected by it.

28
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:10,820
The Spirit Beasts mutated,

29
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,330
increasing in strength.

30
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,490
They even attacked the sects.

31
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,330
Now,

32
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:21,530
chaos reigns in the Sea of Devils.

33
00:02:30,990 --> 00:02:31,970
Sect Leader,

34
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:34,700
you asked for a map of ancient teleportation formations.

35
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,090
I found a place that has one !

36
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:38,260
It's sold in Lian Mo City.

37
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,240
If I want to return to Zhao,

38
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,610
I have to cross the Sea of Devils.

39
00:02:42,790 --> 00:02:44,650
But this place is huge

40
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:47,450
and conflicts have been going on for years.

41
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,230
The fastest way to travel

42
00:02:49,290 --> 00:02:51,850
is ancient teleportation formations.

43
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:55,690
I need to find a map of these formations.

44
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,650
Ma Jinrong
Poison Devil Palace Disciple
Late stage Core Formation

45
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,650
Shangguan Cai
Poison Devil Palace Disciple
Late stage Core Formation

46
00:03:11,990 --> 00:03:14,570
There really is an Eight-clawed Beast here !

47
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:17,130
I've been tracking this beast for months.

48
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,810
But my cultivation is too low

49
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,530
to catch this beast.

50
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,930
I will have to bother the two of you.

51
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,020
Of course,

52
00:03:24,070 --> 00:03:26,430
Brother Qiu is only at Middle stage Core Formation.

53
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:29,810
Just leave the matter of killing this beast to us.

54
00:03:33,250 --> 00:03:36,770
If killing this beast didn't require freshly made poison,

55
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,810
I wouldn't have had to rely on Juniors

56
00:03:38,670 --> 00:03:40,850
with my Nascent Soul cultivation.

57
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,490
Brother Wang,

58
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:47,850
After swallowing that Nascent Soul, I successfully established mine.

59
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:50,250
I don't know if you've succeeded.

60
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:51,850
But if you haven't,

61
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:54,250
when we meet again,

62
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:56,810
I will have to pay you back.

63
00:04:03,010 --> 00:04:07,010
After you finish the poison and kill this beast,

64
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,450
I'll kill you both.

65
00:04:11,790 --> 00:04:14,850
Huh ? I have met an old friend.

66
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,570
Go !

67
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:33,490
Impossible...

68
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:39,250
Such a powerful Divine Sense...

69
00:04:39,550 --> 00:04:42,450
Could it be a monster of the Soul Formation level ?

70
00:04:42,710 --> 00:04:44,050
I've been looking for you.

71
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:46,270
Long time no see.

72
00:04:47,780 --> 00:04:50,010
Does Senior know me ?

73
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,810
It's you !

74
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:58,130
Brother Qiu is really in a good mood.

75
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,580
With your Nascent Soul cultivation,

76
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:02,010
you're playing around with 2 Juniors...

77
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,650
Very interesting.

78
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:06,010
He's Nascent Soul ?

79
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:09,290
If we didn't give the beast to him,

80
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,690
he would've certainly killed us !

81
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:16,170
Thank you for your guidance Senior.

82
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:24,490
Leaving ?

83
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:35,530
These two juniors seem to be

84
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:37,730
from the Poison Devil Palace.

85
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:40,210
That sect takes good care of their disciples.

86
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:41,270
Brother Qiu,

87
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:43,650
you have to be careful in the future.

88
00:05:44,190 --> 00:05:47,930
That guy is a core disciple of the Poison Devil Palace

89
00:05:47,890 --> 00:05:49,650
If he really runs away,

90
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:53,010
I will have problems in the future

91
00:05:52,930 --> 00:05:54,450
This guy...

92
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:58,010
With their Late stage Core Formation speed,

93
00:05:57,980 --> 00:06:00,210
if Brother Qiu quickly chases after them,

94
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:03,100
you might still catch up.

95
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:05,650
Brother Wang,

96
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:09,010
say what's on your mind.

97
00:06:09,170 --> 00:06:11,010
Although our relation isn't deep

98
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:13,330
we still have been through a bit together.

99
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:16,090
Do you have a map of the Sea of Devils ?

100
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,730
I don't have one.

101
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:21,650
But if Brother Wang wants one,

102
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,810
you can go to the treasure pavilions in the cities.

103
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,410
You might have some luck there.

104
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:28,850
Then Brother Qiu should come with me to the city.

105
00:06:28,910 --> 00:06:31,210
We'll buy a map together.

106
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:34,250
You can chase them after I obtain a map.

107
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:38,210
He has forced me into a situation where I need to kill them

108
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,650
but he's blocking me.

109
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,370
Now that I'm in this situation,

110
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,410
I can't wait,

111
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:43,810
I can only comply.

112
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:46,050
That's truly a great scheme...

113
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:52,890
All my knowledge of the Sea of Devils

114
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:55,250
from all the years I have traveled

115
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:57,210
is compiled in this jade.

116
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,130
There might be some mistakes,

117
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,330
but not too many.

118
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:01,250
Brother Wang,

119
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:02,730
If there's nothing else,

120
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,010
I'm leaving.

121
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,370
Thank you.

122
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,250
You're not going to check it ?

123
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,410
Do I need to ?

124
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,530
Brother Wang,

125
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:16,250
I wouldn't give you false information.

126
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:18,210
You can rest assured.

127
00:07:18,970 --> 00:07:21,530
I need to gather multiple maps

128
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,930
to cross reference them

129
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:26,450
and find out the real information.

130
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:30,450
7 days later

131
00:07:33,730 --> 00:07:36,250
There are so many mutants in the Sea of Devils,

132
00:07:36,110 --> 00:07:37,890
yet this guy is just strolling around.

133
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,770
How long until we reach Lian Mo City ?

134
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:42,850
Something's wrong here.

135
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:46,250
I don't hear any sound.

136
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:22,010
Underworld Ice Flame,

137
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:22,850
emerge !

138
00:08:41,420 --> 00:08:43,850
The beast hiding in this mountain

139
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,530
can take a humanoid shape ?

140
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,130
Interesting...

141
00:08:47,930 --> 00:08:49,930
Although the beast isn't strong,

142
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,610
I can help it cultivate to grow in strength.

143
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:53,490
Break !

144
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,040
A mosquito beast ?

145
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:04,650
Tu Si was almost killed by their encirclement before...

146
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:07,730
This one must be of the same race.

147
00:09:15,110 --> 00:09:16,610
I am here !

148
00:09:18,450 --> 00:09:19,930
What the hell is this ?

149
00:09:20,070 --> 00:09:21,850
Why is it even uglier than the ape ?

150
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:24,810
This new devil seems dumb.

151
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:28,290
I'll let him do the dirty work.

152
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:30,610
If it turns out he's useless

153
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,250
I'll just clean up after him.

154
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,050
Such speed !

155
00:09:47,890 --> 00:09:49,250
So powerful !

156
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,450
If it weren't for this stupid ape,

157
00:09:51,210 --> 00:09:53,730
I wouldn't have come out to look for trouble.

158
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:57,250
So it's hard huh ?

159
00:09:57,440 --> 00:10:01,050
I want to see how he will capture this thing.

160
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,170
Split !

161
00:10:04,930 --> 00:10:06,010
Illusion !

162
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:18,010
So it will fight itself.

163
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,450
Master always has good ideas !

164
00:10:29,250 --> 00:10:32,050
It seems that it can not just attack with its dart,

165
00:10:34,290 --> 00:10:37,650
but it can also attack with its mouth.

166
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:46,330
You cannot run away !

167
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:53,450
Master is getting more and more terrifying...

168
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,050
Ridiculous.

169
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:26,730
Master, you are too generous !

170
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:29,050
You've given him too many treasures to absorb !

171
00:11:40,250 --> 00:11:41,330
Let's go.

172
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,730
How about 3 mid quality spirit stones ?

173
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,930
I can't go cheaper.

174
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,840
Let's talk later.

175
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:49,490
Lian Mo City
Sea of Devils

176
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:51,050
Long time no see, fellow cultivator.

177
00:11:51,970 --> 00:11:54,610
The Sea isn't very calm lately.

178
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,450
This is a special item...

179
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:59,930
These artifacts are made from middle grade Spirit Beast bones.

180
00:11:59,830 --> 00:12:01,450
Especially this bell,

181
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,850
it was made out of beast ear drums and wings.

182
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,930
It is extraordinary.

183
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:07,050
I exchange for spirit stones.

184
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:10,610
I want the bell, for 30 spirit stones ?

185
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,570
Sold.

186
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,410
Next person.

187
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,050
This crystal furnace

188
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:17,850
can be exchanged for high grade pills.

189
00:12:18,060 --> 00:12:20,010
I am looking for secret cultivation techniques !

190
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:24,250
I have a book about the secret water sealing pills.

191
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:27,250
This gourd can transmit the voice,

192
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,730
I sell it for 100 spirit stones.

193
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,090
Among all those items

194
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:31,210
maybe one can sell for a high price.

195
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,450
Fellow cultivator, I'm in !

196
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:35,010
It turns there are many strong people hidden here.

197
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:36,290
Fellow Daoist, don't compete with me !

198
00:12:36,140 --> 00:12:37,410
Next person.

199
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:44,810
I will trade sea beast cores for a map of ancient teleportation formations,

200
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:46,050
the more complete, the better.

201
00:12:51,090 --> 00:12:52,090
Little friend,

202
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:56,530
this kind of high quality map is invaluable in the Sea of Devils.

203
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:59,450
It will cost 1000 high quality spirit stones

204
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:03,250
plus some of your items, it might be difficult for you.

205
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,730
A thousand ?

206
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:06,650
Who has this much ?

207
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:07,450
Yeah right ?

208
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:10,130
Then I'll offer a top grade spirit stone.

209
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:11,950
Does anyone have a map ?

210
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,490
Top quality ?!

211
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,330
I heard it wrong.

212
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,850
A top quality spirit stone...

213
00:13:14,590 --> 00:13:15,450
No way !

214
00:13:15,340 --> 00:13:16,850
Aren't they extinct ?

215
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:27,250
Is this a top quality spirit stone ?

216
00:13:32,330 --> 00:13:33,900
Unfortunately I don't have a map...

217
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,650
Next person.

218
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:38,850
Fellow cultivator,

219
00:13:39,770 --> 00:13:42,250
I have what you're looking for.

220
00:13:42,830 --> 00:13:44,890
But with the top quality spirit stone,

221
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:47,290
I want one more thing in exchange.

222
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,220
First, the map.

223
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:55,290
This map not only records the teleportation formations

224
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,730
but also how damaged they are.

225
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,530
What else do you need ?

226
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:02,650
I want you to kill someone.

227
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:04,050
What cultivation level ?

228
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:06,430
Peak Late stage Nascent Soul,

229
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:08,050
Half-Step Soul Formation.

230
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,170
Lead the way.

231
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:17,800
Fellow cultivator,

232
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:19,780
this person is nearby.

233
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,650
You will lay in ambush.

234
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,410
When I invite him out,

235
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,210
you attack.

236
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:25,970
What's wrong ?

237
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,410
You bastard !

238
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,850
I'll kill you !

239
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:36,250
You can all come out.

240
00:14:40,910 --> 00:14:43,050
When did you find out ?

241
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:45,050
When we arrived here.

242
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,410
You are smart.

243
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:50,450
But it's too late.

244
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:52,330
This place is too remote

245
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,610
so no one can help you.

246
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:54,450
You are...

247
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:59,250
Go together, kill him !

248
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:17,250
This sword sheath is exactly the same as the one I used in the past.

249
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:20,090
Is there more of these ?

250
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,730
It has a strong killing intent.

251
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:35,450
The energy is sealed in the sheath.

252
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,490
If I push the sword a third of the way in

253
00:15:37,310 --> 00:15:39,450
it can release this much energy.

254
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:42,250
If I can sheathe it entirely...

255
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,570
Its strength will be tremendous.

256
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:56,010
Spot on.

257
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,590
Take this, and this,

258
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,570
and this spiced beef, take all of it !

259
00:16:33,990 --> 00:16:35,810
outstanding form and spirit.

260
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:39,410
Blood for blood.

261
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:41,170
I will wipe out your Wang Family

262
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:43,250
to avenge my grandson Teng Li !

263
00:16:46,820 --> 00:16:48,050
Wang Lin,

264
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:50,130
look how kind I am !

265
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:53,250
I let you reunite with your parents...

266
00:16:53,730 --> 00:16:55,330
I have waited for this day

267
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,770
for 400 years.

268
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,450
Zhao...

269
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:01,330
I'm coming back !

270
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:17,690
I've had my share of wounds,

271
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:17,690
now I want to fight back.

272
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:21,250
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

273
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:27,170
that's blocking all my hopes

274
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:27,170
for life ?

275
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:32,930
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

276
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:32,930
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

277
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:36,330
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

278
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:42,330
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

279
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:42,330
out of reach.

280
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:47,810
Immortals

281
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:47,810
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

282
00:17:47,840 --> 00:17:51,850
Renegades

283
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:51,850
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

284
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:55,690
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

285
00:17:53,550 --> 00:17:55,690
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

286
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:59,810
because I don't see the harm in that.

287
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:07,610
My new body opens its eyes

288
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:07,610
and awakens from its dream.

289
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:15,170
I have overcome many trials

290
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:15,170
to get this body back.

291
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:22,810
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

292
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:22,810
I can still see.

293
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:32,170
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

294
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:32,170
by my own hands.

295
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:53,570
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

296
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:53,570
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

297
00:18:53,320 --> 00:19:01,130
With a flick of a finger,

298
00:18:54,760 --> 00:19:01,130
only my indomitable heart remains.

299
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:10,530
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

300
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:10,530
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

301
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:18,370
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

302
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:18,370
like the descent of a god.
